flowchart TD
 Answer["answer commit: waiting"] --> Claim["markSending: no second body send"]
 Claim --> Open["call_open"]
 Open -->|guaranteed unopened directory_link_down| Retry["30 seconds / answer + 10-minute bound"]
 Retry --> Claim
 Open -->|session known| Checkpoint["DB: session_id before call_send"]
 Checkpoint --> Send["call_send once"]
 Send -->|queued / response lost| Track["DB: session + optional seq; pending"]
 Track --> Info["same-party call_info: no read marking"]
 Info -->|queued / inflight / network failure| Track
 Info -->|one seq 1 after lost response| Seq["persist recovered seq"]
 Seq --> Info
 Info -->|submitted / failed / unknown| Commit["transaction: journal terminal + reportDelivery"]
 Send -->|legacy delivered / explicit error| Commit
 Commit --> Close["call_hangup only after terminal commit"]
 Close -->|response failure| Again["keep terminal; retry only hangup"]
 Again --> Close
 Close -->|accepted| Closed["closed journal until decision deletion"]
 Restart["process restart"] -->|journal exists| Track
 Restart -->|terminal journal| Close
 Restart -->|old sending without session| Unknown["unknown; never resend body"]
 Get["explicit get / fetched"] --> Preserve["keep fetched; track original call only"]
 Preserve --> Track
 Info -->|no matching receipt / ambiguous seq| Track
 Commit --> UI["submitted = gateway accepted; not AI work complete"]
